    +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
    |                     SAFE EXECUTION & PARSING SERVICE                              |
    |                                                                                   |
    |  +------------------------+  +------------------------+  +---------------------+  |
    |  | Command Allow-List     |  | Privileged Helper      |  | Regex/Text Parsers  |  |
    |  | Verification           |  | (Polkit / Sudo Daemon) |  | (Structured JSON)   |  |
